This repository redistributes three PEAR packages. Each of them is released
under the 3-clause BSD license, with its own copyright holders. The license
texts shipped with the original packages are kept in licenses/, and the
copyright notice in every source file is unchanged.

  HTTP_Download  licenses/HTTP_Download.LICENSE
  HTTP_Header    licenses/HTTP_Header.LICENSE
  HTTP           no license file in the original package; the source header
                 states "New BSD License" (2002-2008 The Authors)

The few lines changed from the originals (see NOTICE.md) and the files that
were added (README.md, NOTICE.md, composer.json, tests/) are offered under the
same BSD 3-clause terms.
